# /settings' Prompt history row and the history file: a prompt kept, history
# off (a prompt kept nowhere), on again (a prompt kept), then a fresh launch
# on the same HOME and what Up recalls there. Each step's file by `home`.
# fx's harness launches it with FX_SOUND=0; xfx is given the same start.
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
gateway settings-history-turns.json
wait 2
type first prompt
key Enter
wait 2
home first
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
key Up
wait 0.3
snap marked
key Right
wait 0.8
snap off
home off
key Escape
wait 0.5
type secret prompt
key Enter
wait 2
home secret
key Up
wait 0.4
snap up-after-secret
key C-u
wait 0.3
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
key Up
wait 0.3
key Right
wait 0.8
snap on
home on
key Escape
wait 0.5
type public prompt
key Enter
wait 2
home public
keep
key C-c
wait 0.3
key C-c
wait 1.5
fx: relaunch --model=fake/model-a
xfx: relaunch
wait 2.5
snap relaunch
key Up
wait 0.4
snap relaunch-up1
key Up
wait 0.4
snap relaunch-up2
key Up
wait 0.4
snap relaunch-up3
key Up
wait 0.4
snap relaunch-up4
home end
